Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.00,0:05:27.60,Title,0,0,0,0,,《007系列之金手指》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.84,0:03:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 恭喜 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Congratulations. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.01,0:03:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫先生和他朋友将要失业了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Romales and his friends will be out of business.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.93,0:03:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少他不会用海洛因口味的香蕉 去支助革命\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't be using heroin-flavoured bananas to finance revolutions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.37,0:03:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要回酒店 他们会监视你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go back to your hotel, ser. They'll be watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.72,0:03:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一小时后有飞机飞往迈阿密 - 我会上飞机…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's a plane to Miami in an hour. - I'll be on it, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.61,0:03:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,…但首先我要办点事\N{\fnArial\fs30}first I have some unfinished business to attend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.47,0:03:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.14,0:03:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你总是带着这个东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you always wear that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.31,0:03:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有轻微的自卑情结\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a slight inferiority complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.81,0:03:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚才在做什么？对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where was I?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.78,0:04:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,被电死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shocking!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.83,0:04:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对是被电死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Positively shocking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.20,0:09:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 感觉如何？- 非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's this? - It's nice… Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.70,0:09:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里？- 再低点 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just here? - No, a little lower.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.66,0:09:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你会被照顾得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I'd find you in good hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.21,0:09:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,费立斯！你好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Felix! How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.92,0:09:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 丁克 来见见费立斯 - 哈罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dink, meet Felix Leiter. - Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.09,0:09:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 费立斯 这是丁克 - 嗨 丁克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Felix, say hello to Dink. - Hi, Dink.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.26,0:09:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁克 和费立斯说再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dink, say goodbye to Felix.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.43,0:09:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是男人之间的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.31,0:09:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你精神松懈了 007 让对手如此接近你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be slipping, 007, letting the opposition get that close to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.35,0:09:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在牙买加更加接近 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got a lot closer to you in Jamaica.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.73,0:09:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,在想什么？我在渡假\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's on your mind? I'm on holiday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.98,0:09:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再是了 伦敦有指示来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not any more, you're not. Signal from London.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.69,0:09:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道M让我住最好的旅馆 绝非好意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew M wouldn't book me into the best hotel here out of gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.40,0:09:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他交待我们替你盯着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He asked us to keep an eye on him for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.61,0:09:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥瑞克金手指 听起来像法国指甲油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Auric Goldfinger. Sounds like a French nail varnish!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.83,0:09:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是英国人 但口音不像\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's British. But he doesn't sound like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.33,0:09:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,大企业家 事业横跨世界 全是合法生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big operator, worldwide interests. All seem reputable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.50,0:09:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,拥有一个全美最好的马场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Owns one of the finest US stud farms.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.67,0:09:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这和华府有什么关联？- 中情局认为他没有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's the tie-up with Washington? - He's clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.67,0:09:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里找得到他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where do I find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.97,0:10:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他的凯子 正在等他\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's his pigeon waiting for him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.35,0:10:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,金手指已连赢他一周了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goldfinger's been taking him to the cleaners every day for a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.56,0:10:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,早 西蒙先生 准备开始了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning, Mr Simmons! Ready for our little game?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.44,0:10:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然准备好了 输了一万元 随时准备好翻本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. When you're ten grand in the hole, you're ready for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.40,0:10:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能要我的老位子吗？- 你和你的日光浴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Could I have my usual seat? - You and your suntan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.20,0:10:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,金手指是位杰出的玩牌高手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goldfinger's a fabulous card player.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.45,0:10:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 同样赌注？- 加倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Same stakes? - Let's double it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.04,0:10:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,一分5元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five dollars a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.58,0:10:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说5元吗？- 我总会转运的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you say five? - My luck's gotta change some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.75,0:10:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.30,0:10:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回公司发电报给M 说你已在办案了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get back and cable M you're on the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.88,0:10:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 其他的资料在晚饭时再告诉我 - 等一会打给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fill me in on the rest at dinner. - Fine. I'll call you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.03,0:11:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 四 - 这么快？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Four. - So soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.91,0:11:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,几分？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.83,0:11:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,7 12 18 32…\N{\fnArial\fs30}7, 12, 18, 32…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,44.\N{\fnArial\fs30}44.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.59,0:11:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.80,0:11:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what are you…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.26,0:11:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是金手指先生的套房！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Mr Goldfinger's suite!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.43,0:11:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.98,0:11:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很甜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're very sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.44,0:11:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他刚拿一张梅花老K 让他有59分\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just drew the king of clubs. That makes his count 59.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.61,0:11:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有红心同花顺 8 9 10\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got a diamond run: Eight, nine, ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.58,0:11:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他手上留着黑桃6 我想他认为你会要\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's holding on to the six of spades, so I guess he thinks you want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.04,0:11:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,上一张牌是红心8\N{\fnArial\fs30}That last draw was the eight of hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.38,0:11:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要老K和皇后\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs kings and queens.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.84,0:12:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁？- 邦德 詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - Bond. James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.60,0:12:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,快些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.11,0:12:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才像话！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's more like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.07,0:12:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你叫什么名字？- 吉儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's your name? - Jill.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.24,0:12:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪位吉儿？- 吉儿马特生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jill who? - Jill Masterson.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.78,0:12:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 告诉我 吉儿 他为何这么做？- 他喜欢赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell me, Jill. Why does he do it? - He likes to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.12,0:12:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你为何这么做？- 他请我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why do you do it? - He pays me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.00,0:12:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他只请你做这个？- 还有和他一起露面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that all he pays you for? - And for being seen with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.92,0:12:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是露面？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just seen?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.96,0:12:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.68,0:12:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我放心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.64,0:12:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你人太好 不该卷入这种件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're much too nice to be mixed up in anything like this, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.81,0:13:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 金手指 你的运气变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now hear this, Goldfinger. Your luck has just changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.78,0:13:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怀疑迈阿密警方不会纵容…你这种行为的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt if the Miami Beach police would take kindly to what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.49,0:13:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,同意就点头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nod your head if you agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.29,0:13:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,点头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nod.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.50,0:13:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 现在起开始输 金手指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good! Now start losing, Goldfinger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.00,0:13:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,一万元如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we say $10, 000?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.25,0:13:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,大方些\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, let's be generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.42,0:13:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,算一万五好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's make it $15, 000.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.22,0:13:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能看吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I see?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.94,0:13:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我很顺手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I can see this is really my day!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.35,0:13:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.16,0:13:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,通话完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over and out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.95,0:13:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这够他忙上一阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should keep him occupied for quite some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.04,0:13:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 我开始喜欢你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm beginning to like you, Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.21,0:13:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me James.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.87,0:14:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好久没有遇上你这种人了 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than anyone I've met in a long time… James.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.55,0:14:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于这点 我们打算怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What on earth are we going to do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.51,0:14:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 怎么办呢？- 晚饭时再告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. What? - I'll tell you at dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.01,0:14:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.18,0:14:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,城里最好的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I know the best place in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.70,0:14:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,WEBS电台新闻报导\N{\fnArial\fs30}Station WEDS brings you the latest in world news.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.33,0:14:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,华府消息 总统今天下午…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Washington. At the White House today,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.71,0:14:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,…在白宫说很满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}the President said he was entirely satisfied…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.96,0:14:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下有两人很满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}That makes two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.02,0:14:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 我是莱特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. - Leiter here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.18,0:15:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,费立斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Felix! Well, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.35,0:15:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？吃晚饭？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that? Dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.52,0:15:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, look, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.69,0:15:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没空 有重要事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. Something big's come up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.24,0:15:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,早餐如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.41,0:15:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要太早\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK Not too early.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.57,0:15:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 9点打给你 - 好 9点好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll call you around nine. - Yes, nine o'clock will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.62,0:15:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 - 晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So long, James. - Good night, Felix.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.97,0:15:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,放太久就不冰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's lost its chill!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.10,0:15:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 怎么 你！- 冰箱里面还有一瓶\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why, you! - There's another in the fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.85,0:15:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁需要啊？- 亲爱的女孩 有些事 还没到时间就不能做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who needs it? - My dear, some things just aren't done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.69,0:15:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如喝唐派里昂53年的香槟…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such as drinking Dom Pignon '53…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.57,0:15:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,…温度却超过38度\N{\fnArial\fs30}above a temperature of 38?Fahrenheit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.53,0:15:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像不戴耳机 听披头四的歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's as bad as listening to the Beatles without earmuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.87,0:15:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,“热情之液”在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now… where is this passion juice?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.83,0:16:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jill?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.12,0:17:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Mr Bond?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.24,0:17:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,请接海滩79432 119号房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beach 79432. Room 119.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.88,0:17:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂？- 费立斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Hello, Felix.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.05,0:17:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get over here right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.18,0:17:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？- 那女孩死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's happened? - The girl's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.68,0:17:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 丁克？- 不 吉儿马特生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dink? - No, Masterson. Jill Masterson.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.60,0:17:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,全身被涂漆 金漆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she's covered in paint. Gold paint.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.20,0:17:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,金的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gold?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.95,0:18:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,全身？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All over?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.07,0:18:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是因为皮肤窒息而死 曾发生在歌舞女郎身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}She died of skin suffocation. It can happen to cabaret dancers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.70,0:18:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要在背脊上留个面积 让皮肤能够呼吸…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should leave a small bare patch at the base of the spine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.16,0:18:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,…就会没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}to allow the skin to breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.33,0:18:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很明显的 有人没有留面积 - 我知道是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Someone obviously didn't. - And I know who.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.88,0:18:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是私人恩怨 007 这是任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a personal vendetta, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.39,0:18:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟别的任务一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an assignment like any other.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.55,0:18:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不能冷静客观处理…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you can't treat it as such, coldly and objectively,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.64,0:18:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,…008可以接替\N{\fnArial\fs30}008 can replace you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.77,0:18:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是认不清楚自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've hardly distinguished yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.19,0:18:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该监视金手指先生 不是去借用他女友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were to observe Mr Goldfinger. Not borrow his girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.03,0:18:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因如此 金手指去了欧洲 因为主的恩赐…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead, Goldfinger goes to Europe and it's only thanks to Leiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.70,0:18:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,…莱特和我对 华府的英国大使馆施压力…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my diplomatic intervention.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.91,0:18:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才没有被迈阿密警方扣留\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you're not being held by the Miami Beach police!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.83,0:18:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我自己的缺点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I am aware of my shortcomings.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.00,0:18:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备依你的建议…继续此项任务…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm prepared to continue this assignment in the spirit you suggest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.67,0:18:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,…如果我知道是 怎么回事的话…\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I knew what it was about,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.46,0:18:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,…长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.34,0:19:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对黄金了解多少？不是金漆 是金砖\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know about gold? Not paint, bullion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.84,0:19:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到时我会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it when I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.01,0:19:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,7点这里见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet me here at seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.97,0:19:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿礼服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black tie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.52,0:19:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱班霓 你对黄金了解多少？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know about gold, Moneypenny?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.11,0:19:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道你戴的那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only gold I know about is the kind you wear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.99,0:19:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴在左手无名指那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, on the third finger of your left hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.66,0:19:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天 要好好查查\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of these days we really must look into that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.33,0:19:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚如何？过来吃晚饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about tonight? Come round for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.50,0:19:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我烤蛋糕给你吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll cook you a beautiful angel cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.17,0:19:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么事让我更高兴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing would give me greater pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.54,0:19:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我生意上有约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}but unfortunately I do have a… business appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.17,0:19:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我听过最差的藉口\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the flimsiest excuse you've ever given me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.34,0:19:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的女孩就有那种运气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some girls have all the luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.09,0:19:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她是谁？詹姆斯 - “她”是我 钱班霓小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is she, James? - She is me, Miss Moneypenny,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.10,0:19:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你别和007胡闹了 他跟我一起吃晚饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}and kindly omit the customary by-play with 007. He's dining with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.44,0:19:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望他迟到\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I don't want him to be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.10,0:19:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我还有希望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there's hope for me yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.86,0:20:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱班霓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moneypenny…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.03,0:20:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候会开始相信我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't you ever believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.82,0:20:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,英伦银行是官方存放\N{\fnArial\fs30}We here at the Bank of England.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.99,0:20:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,金块之地…\N{\fnArial\fs30}are the official depository for gold bullion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.91,0:20:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,…如美国肯塔基州的 诺克堡一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just as Fort Knox, Kentucky, is for the United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.21,0:20:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道彼此有多少金块 在手上 有多少存放在别的银行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know the amounts we each hold and the amounts deposited in other banks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.29,0:20:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,也能估计工业界持有多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can estimate what is being held for industrial purposes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.71,0:20:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让两国政府建立…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thus, both governments can establish.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.13,0:20:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,…美元和英镑的真正价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}the true value of the dollar and the pound.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.59,0:20:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,近来 我们相当关切 非法交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consequently, we are concerned with unauthorised leakages.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.10,0:20:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是指走私\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take it you mean smuggling.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.27,0:20:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.89,0:20:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄金能被溶化后再还原 而且不会留下痕迹…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gold, gentlemen, which can be melted down and recast, is all but untraceable,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.73,0:20:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,…让黄金 不像是钻石 成为走私最理想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}which makes it, unlike diamonds, ideal for smuggling,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.15,0:20:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,…吸引到最大和最聪明的罪犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}attracting the biggest and most ingenious criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.53,0:20:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 就这样 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you, Brunskill. That'll be all. - Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.78,0:20:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一些令人失望的白兰地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a little more of this… rather disappointing brandy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.20,0:20:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？- 这是30年老而且\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's the matter with it? - I'd say it was a 30-year-old Fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.00,0:20:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,搅拌不完全…\N{\fnArial\fs30}indifferently blended, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.21,0:21:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,…加了太多香料的酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}With an overdose of Bons Bois.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.13,0:21:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,史上校正在演讲 007\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel Smithers is giving the lecture, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.43,0:21:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,金手指在苏黎世 和阿姆斯特丹…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, Mr Goldfinger has gold bullion on deposit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.18,0:21:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,…克拉兹 香港都存有 价值二千万英镑金块\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Zurich, Amsterdam, Caracas and Hong Kong, worth 20 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.10,0:21:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大多数来自本国 - 为什么要提走？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Most of it came from this country. - Why move it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.52,0:21:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为各国的价格不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}The price of gold varies from country to country.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.35,0:21:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里买一盎斯30元 巴基斯坦可卖到110元…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you buy it here at $30 an ounce, you can sell it in, say, Pakistan at $110…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.69,0:21:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,…价钱变3倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}and triple your money.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.78,0:21:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果他有设备溶化它的话 - 他有吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If you have facilities for melting it down. - And has he?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.11,0:21:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,身为正当的金块交易者 金手指他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apart from being a legitimate bullion dealer, Mr Goldfinger poses…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.87,0:21:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这不公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's not quite fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.87,0:21:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他众多生意中 他是一名正当的国际珠宝商\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is, among his many other interests, a legitimate international jeweller.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.54,0:21:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能合法的适度的操作冶金设备\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's legally entitled to operate modest metallurgical installations.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.09,0:21:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他英国的工厂就在肯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}His British one is down in Kent.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.67,0:21:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前为止仍查不出\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've failed to discover how he transfers his gold overseas.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.05,0:21:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他如何把金子转到海外\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Lord knows we've tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.01,0:21:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你的部门 能查出他在违法…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your department can establish that it is done illegally,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.10,0:21:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,…那银行就能扣查他的黄金\N{\fnArial\fs30}the bank can take action to recover most of his holdings.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.39,0:22:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,该是我和金手指见面的时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's time Mr Goldfinger and I met.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.98,0:22:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Socially, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.15,0:22:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正等着你这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was hoping you'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.82,0:22:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许会牵扯到金手指先生 蛮专业的生意上的话题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might lead to a business talk… Mr Goldfinger's kind of business.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.82,0:22:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我需要诱饵 - 我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll need some sort of bait. - I quite agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.99,0:22:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,掳获纳粹藏在脱兹湖时 留下的唯一一块\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the only one we have from the Nazi hoard in Lake Toplitz.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.95,0:22:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然还有其他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there are undoubtedly others.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.83,0:22:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生可以任意使用…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Bond can make whatever use of it he thinks fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.59,0:22:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,…不过 当然要归还\N{\fnArial\fs30}Providing he returns it, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.00,0:22:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,价值五千英镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's worth 5, 000.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.89,0:22:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明早向Q拿黄金 还有其他装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll draw it from Q branch with your equipment in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.47,0:22:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.24,0:22:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早 Q - 早 007\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Morning, Q. - Morning, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.45,0:22:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边请\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.62,0:22:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,今早大伙儿都很忙啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My, we are busy this morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.71,0:23:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不够完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not perfected yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.92,0:23:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的班特利车呢？- 恐怕已经过时\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's my Bentley? - It's had its day, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.63,0:23:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它从未令我失望过 - M的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But it's never let me down. - M's orders, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.68,0:23:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将用改装过的 奥斯丁克马田DB5\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be using this Aston Martin DB5 with modifications.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.31,0:23:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,请注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, pay attention, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.48,0:23:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,防弹玻璃…两侧和后窗都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Windscreen-bulletproof. As are the side and the rear windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.52,0:23:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,各种车牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Revolving number plates, naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.94,0:23:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,各国都适用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Valid all countries.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.95,0:23:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是小发报器 叫做“归者”\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's a nice little transmitting device, called a homer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.74,0:23:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,压住后面拉开就行了 知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You prime it by pressing that back like this. You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.37,0:23:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,更小的模式 现在已经是标准配备…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The smaller model is now standard field issue,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.25,0:23:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,…可以放在鞋后跟\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be fitted into the heel of your shoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.71,0:23:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,大型的具有磁性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its larger brother is magnetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.42,0:23:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以利用车内追踪荧幕…而不被发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. It'll be concealed in the car you're trailing while you keep out of sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.47,0:23:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,接受器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reception.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.64,0:23:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,在表板上\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the dashboard here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.64,0:24:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,荧幕装置 有效距离150英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Audiovisual, range 150 miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.19,0:24:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,聪明而有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ingenious, and useful too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.48,0:24:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让男人偷闲一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow a man to stop off for a quick one en route.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.40,0:24:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们多年来追求完美和 耐心的研究…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has not been perfected out of years of patient research.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.28,0:24:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,…不是为了这个目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}entirely for that purpose, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.20,0:24:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便提一下 我很感激你…把它还有 别的装备一起归还\N{\fnArial\fs30}And incidentally we'd appreciate its return, along with your other equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.99,0:24:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少要有一次 在你出完任务后 能完整的送回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intact, for once, when you return from the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.00,0:24:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道在外工作的辛苦血泪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd be surprised at the wear and tear that goes on out there in the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.34,0:24:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有其他的吗？- 如果你专心的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anything else? - I won't keep you for more than an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.67,0:24:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该不会超过一小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you give me your undivided attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.09,0:24:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做了有趣的改装\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've installed some interesting modifications.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.89,0:24:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到这扶手了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see this arm here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.18,0:24:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开顶盖 里面是防卫性控制器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, open the top and inside are your defence mechanism controls.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.43,0:24:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,烟幕 滑油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smoke screen. Oil slick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.90,0:24:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,后窗防弹幕…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rear bulletproof screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.06,0:24:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,…左、右前置机枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And left and right front-wing machine guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.73,0:24:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个我要特别介绍 看见这排挡杆吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this one I'm particularly keen about. You see the gear lever here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.99,0:24:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果把顶盖拿掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if you take the top off,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.24,0:24:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个红色小按钮\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll find a little red button.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.37,0:25:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不论你做什么 不要碰它 - 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whatever you do, don't touch it. - And why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.16,0:25:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,会把车顶掀掉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you'll release this section of the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.17,0:25:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,…并把客座椅弹射出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and engage and fire the passenger ejector seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.50,0:25:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹射座位？你在开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ejector seat? You're joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.34,0:25:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从不对我的工作开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never joke about my work, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.31,0:25:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好了吗？- 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ready, Blacking? - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.47,0:25:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,有位老会员也来 也是个高手\N{\fnArial\fs30}An old member has dropped by, sir. Same handicap as yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.77,0:25:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想和他较量吗？- 他在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wondered if you'd rather play with him. - Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.94,0:25:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 邦德先生 - 是的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr Bond. - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.28,0:25:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是金手指先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Mr Goldfinger.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.03,0:25:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 幸会 - 幸会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you do? - How do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.95,0:25:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以开始了 第一洞有空了 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can leave now. The first tee is clear. - Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.29,0:25:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会找位球童帮你拿球袋 - 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hawker will caddy for you, Mr Bond. - That'll be splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.92,0:25:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一球一先令好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we make it a shilling a hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.63,0:25:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我带了一些装备 - 嗯 可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll take some tees. - Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.05,0:26:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要原谅这位“怪侠”\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must excuse "Oddjob", Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.18,0:26:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个好仆人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's an admirable manservant.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.31,0:26:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且是个哑巴 但不是个好球童\N{\fnArial\fs30}but mute. He's not a very good caddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.60,0:26:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,高尔夫球在韩国 还不是全国运动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Golf is not yet the national game of Korea.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.53,0:26:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次碰面不是巧合吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This meeting is not a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.37,0:26:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你玩什么把戏？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your game, Mr Bond?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.29,0:26:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的把戏？- 你不是来打高尔夫球的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My game? - You didn't come here to play golf.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.61,0:27:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,1940年在艾森塑造成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A 1940 smelt from the Weigenhaler foundry at Essen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.70,0:27:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 总数约600 - 1944年失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Part of a smelt of 600. - They vanished in 1944.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.58,0:27:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,当纳粹战败时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the Nazis were on the run.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.74,0:27:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还有吗？- 有 同样一个来源\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you have access to more? - Yes, from the same source.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.79,0:27:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.79,0:27:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还剩两个洞 - 对 不分胜负\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Two holes to go. - Yes, and all square.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.29,0:27:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不反对提高赌注？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you have no objection to increasing the stakes?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.67,0:27:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想如何赌？- 当然是你那块金块\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. What do you have in mind? - The bar of gold you have, naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.97,0:27:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 值五千英镑 - 我用同值现金\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's worth 5, 000. - Oh, I'll stake the cash equivalent!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.89,0:27:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.73,0:27:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全遵照高尔夫球规定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strict rules of golf?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.94,0:27:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}But of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.81,0:28:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,运气不好 球落在乱草中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad luck, you're in the rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.32,0:28:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可惜 在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a pity. Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.78,0:28:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个不是 他是一号球\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not. He plays a Slazenger 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.16,0:28:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全遵照高尔夫球规定 5分钟快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strict rules of golf, Goldfinger. Five minutes are almost up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.63,0:28:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,找不到球罚一棍\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lost ball will cost you stroke and distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.14,0:28:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仍在训练他当球童\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still training him as a caddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.40,0:29:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,也蛮成功的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Successfully, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.86,0:29:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,1号球？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slazenger No. 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.95,0:29:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.66,0:29:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那是他原先的球 我就是球王了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that's his original ball, I'm Arnold Palmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.08,0:29:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.00,0:29:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道？- 我正站在它上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you know? - I'm standing on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.25,0:29:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这老狐…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, you crafty old…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.79,0:29:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要碰它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.71,0:29:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 用你找到的球？- 对 7号球\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The ball you found, sir? - Yes, Slazenger 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.05,0:29:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们和金手指先生开个玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's have a little fun with Mr Goldfinger.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.10,0:29:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我标示还是先打？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like me to mark it or knock it in?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.27,0:29:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,打吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.27,0:29:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 此击一决胜负？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This for a half. - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.58,0:29:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一洞 关键性的一洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}One to go, that will be the clincher.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.75,0:30:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.21,0:30:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把球换过了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you switch 'em, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.96,0:30:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那骗到他了 - 如果他没注意到换球的话.\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then we've got him. - If he doesn't notice the switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.22,0:30:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 应该你先发球 - 没有关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's your honour, sir. - It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.00,0:30:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,低于5棍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down in five.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.00,0:30:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须打进才赢 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to sink this to halve the game, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.47,0:30:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你赢了 - 似乎我比你打得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You win, Goldfinger. - It seems I'm too good for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.43,0:31:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打的是1号球吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You play a Slazenger 1, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.56,0:31:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是 为什么？- 这是7号球\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, why? - This is a Slazenger 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.19,0:31:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's my Penfold Hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.61,0:31:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定在18洞时打错球\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have played the wrong ball on the 18th fairway.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.82,0:31:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是完全照规定打球\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are playing strict rules, so.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.99,0:31:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕你这个洞和整个比赛都输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid you lose the hole and the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.61,0:31:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真美 她是凡顿3型 37年的车 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a beauty. Phantom III, '37, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.49,0:31:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你很聪明而且阅历丰富 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You are clever and resourceful, Mr Bond. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.29,0:32:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许太聪明了 我们曾交过两次手 就让它这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps too clever. Twice our paths have crossed. Let's leave it at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.08,0:32:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次交手时就应该说服了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't our first meeting convince you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.59,0:32:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了 你担心我不跟你再打一场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see. You're worried about me not giving you a return game.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.09,0:32:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们彼此心知肚明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of us know perfectly well what we're talking about, Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.10,0:32:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我认为有必要再提醒你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I see that it is necessary to remind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.47,0:32:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,“怪侠”！\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Oddjob"!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.56,0:32:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人想干涉我的事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many people have tried to involve themselves in my affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.36,0:32:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,…却都失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unsuccessfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.12,0:32:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,了不起！但不知 俱乐部的秘书会怎么说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remarkable. But what does the club secretary have to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.58,0:32:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有什么 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing, Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.75,0:32:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,俱乐部是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I own the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.38,0:32:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你大概要现金支票\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assume you want the cheque made out to cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.26,0:32:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样会令人满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be perfectly satisfactory.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.64,0:33:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,再会 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.27,0:33:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信这是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe this is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.89,0:33:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,请各位注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I have your attention, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.48,0:33:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,英航最后声明…\N{\fnArial\fs30}British United Air Ferries announce the final call.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.19,0:33:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,…前往日内瓦的VF四百班机\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the departure of their VF400 flight to Geneva.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.16,0:34:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,…即将起飞…\N{\fnArial\fs30}British United Air Ferries announce the departure of their VF400 flight to Geneva.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.45,0:34:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Bond!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.16,0:34:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮你安排了半小时后 搭下班飞机飞往日内瓦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got you booked on the next flight to Geneva, leaving in half an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.13,0:34:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you very much. - Right, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.04,0:35:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,007 守纪律\N{\fnArial\fs30}Discipline, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.67,0:35:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,守纪律\N{\fnArial\fs30}Discipline.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.43,0:37:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不要紧吧？让我帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right? Here, let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.85,0:37:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能活着真幸运 - 别指望我会感激你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know, you're lucky to be alive. - No thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.89,0:37:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该再靠边点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've pulled over further.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.90,0:38:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at them!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.52,0:38:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,两轮一起爆 我从没见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}A double blowout. I've never seen one of these before.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.03,0:38:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 新的车胎怎么会… - 也许是次货\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How could new tyres… - A defect of some kind, most likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.91,0:38:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴只是车毁而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so glad it's the car and not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.07,0:38:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不像短命的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't look like a girl who should be ditched.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.83,0:38:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说了 请带我到最近的修车厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind that. Please take me to a garage.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.29,0:38:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.50,0:38:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, my name is Bond, Ja…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.67,0:38:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,请尽快\N{\fnArial\fs30}As quickly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.05,0:38:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我来拿 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll take that. - Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.85,0:38:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name, by the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.02,0:38:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑姆 提莉桑姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soames. Tilly Soames.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.86,0:38:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,来打猎的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here for the hunting season?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.82,0:38:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有一个这种箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a case just like that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.99,0:38:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的冰刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for my ice skates.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.95,0:38:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错的运动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovely sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.58,0:39:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在哪里溜冰？- 圣莫瑞兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where do you skate? - St Moritz.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.84,0:39:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有听过这时候那里会结冰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know there was ice there this time of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.17,0:39:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有修车厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a garage.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.79,0:39:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,换新车胎需要24小时 附近有间酒店\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say it'll take 24 hours to get new tyres. There's a hotel nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.80,0:39:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我送你去 - 不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jump in. I'll run you down. - That won't be necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.42,0:39:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不愿单独留下你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to leave you here alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.59,0:39:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能照顾自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can take care of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.76,0:39:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'm sure you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.93,0:39:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要忘记写信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well… don't forget to write.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.26,0:41:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,走私是种艺术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smuggling is an art, Mr Ling.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.30,0:42:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,艺术的标准是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And art requires…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.64,0:42:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我18K金的手工打造的 劳斯莱斯车身\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this case, the bodywork of my Rolls Royce is 18-carat gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.60,0:42:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这里分解它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We dismantle it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.69,0:42:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用这特制的炉炼出…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reduce the gold in this special furnace, which in turn…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.74,0:42:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,重量约有两吨的金砖\N{\fnArial\fs30}…weighing approximately two tons.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.28,0:42:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我平均一年六次 坐这车到大陆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I make six trips a year to Europe in the Rolls Royce, Mr Ling.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.74,0:42:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂缓你其他的活动 是明智的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be wiser to suspend your other activities.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.54,0:42:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,全心执行满贯计划…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Ling, please assure your principals.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.29,0:42:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,…是我第一要务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Operation Grand Slam will have my undivided attention…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.56,0:43:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我 你快弄断我的背了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go! You're breaking my back!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.65,0:43:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在这里做什么？- 我要杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell are you doing here? - I want to kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.86,0:43:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杀谁？- 金手指\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kill who? - Goldfinger.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.03,0:43:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要他活着 - 我要他死 他杀了我姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, I want him alive. - I want him dead! He killed my sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.74,0:43:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,T.M.泰莉麦特生\N{\fnArial\fs30}TM. Tilly Masterson.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.91,0:43:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得你姐姐吉儿 和他在迈阿密对她做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew your sister Jill. I know what he did to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.75,0:43:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不了解！放开我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.92,0:43:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果你要杀他 为何对我开枪？- 我不是 我是对他开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So why did you shoot at me? - I didn't. I was shooting at him!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.38,0:43:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪法太差劲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're a lousy shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.84,0:43:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有人枪法很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}But somebody else around here isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.01,0:44:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.52,0:44:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上车 我应付他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the car. I'll take care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.72,0:46:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你时 你跑向那树丛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run for that bracken when I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.69,0:46:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.15,0:50:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,007 晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.15,0:50:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.69,0:50:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种特殊行业的佼佼者\N{\fnArial\fs30}And members of your curious profession are few in number.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.32,0:50:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被一位和你一样有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have been recognised.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.49,0:50:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,…杀人执照的对手 认出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's say by one of your opposite numbers, who is also licensed to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.83,0:50:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的车很有趣！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That interesting car of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.34,0:50:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有新玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, too, have a new toy, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.50,0:50:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但更实用\N{\fnArial\fs30}considerably more practical.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.63,0:50:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到的工业用雷射…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are looking at an industrial laser,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.47,0:51:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,…能产生非比寻常的光\N{\fnArial\fs30}which emits an extraordinary light, unknown in nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.68,0:51:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,能发射到月球\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can project a spot on the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.27,0:51:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,或近距离内切割金属 让你见识一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or at closer range, cut through solid metal. I will show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.21,0:51:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是黄金\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gold, Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.22,0:51:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这生中最喜欢的颜色…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All my life, I've been in love with its colour,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.26,0:51:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,…光泽和无可比拟的特性\N{\fnArial\fs30}its brilliance, its divine heaviness.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.64,0:51:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎任何增加 我存量的企业…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I welcome any enterprise that will increase my stock,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.40,0:51:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,…都列入考量\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is considerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.32,0:51:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你表达了你的意见 谢谢你的示范\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you've made your point. Thank you for the demonstration.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.45,0:52:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心选择你的妙语 那可能是你最后一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Choose your next witticism carefully, Mr Bond. It may be your last.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.24,0:52:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,前两次交手的目的 我已很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}The purpose of our two encounters is now very clear to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.62,0:52:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想被分散注意力 晚安 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not intend to be distracted by another. Good night, Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.17,0:52:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你希望我招供？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you expect me to talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.92,0:52:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我要你死\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Mr Bond! I expect you to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.43,0:52:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有事可以告诉我的 我全都知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is nothing you can talk to me about that I don't already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.69,0:52:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘了一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're forgetting one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.20,0:52:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我不报到 008就会接替我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I fail to report, 008 replaces me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.37,0:52:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信他会更成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust he will be more successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.79,0:52:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道我所知的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows what I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.79,0:52:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 你什么都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know nothing, Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.46,0:52:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如说满贯计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Operation Grand Slam, for instance.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.49,0:53:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无意中听到这几个字…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two words you may have overheard.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.95,0:53:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你和组织中的任何人 不可能明白其中含意\N{\fnArial\fs30}which cannot have any significance to you or anyone in your organisation.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.95,0:53:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能冒这个险吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you afford to take that chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.51,0:53:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are quite right, Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.31,0:53:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你活着对我较有价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are worth more to me alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.30,0:54:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.47,0:54:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫普西葛罗尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Pussy Galore.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.93,0:54:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定在做梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must be dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.28,0:54:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I'd wake up dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.91,0:54:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻醉枪 令你不省人事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tranquilliser gun. Knockout shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.08,0:54:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.46,0:54:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴来此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm delighted to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.67,0:55:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 这是哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, by the way, where is here?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.67,0:55:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,3万5千英尺高空 往西南方 正飞过纽芬兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}35, 000 feet flying southwest over Newfoundland.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.18,0:55:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,难怪耳鸣\N{\fnArial\fs30}That explains the humming.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.35,0:55:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在金手指私人飞机上 正飞往巴尔的摩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means you're in Mr Goldfinger's Lockheed JetStar, heading for Baltimore.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.48,0:55:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是他的客人 - 很荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you're his guest. - I'm honoured.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.98,0:55:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他这么喜欢我陪他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never realised he enjoyed my company that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.48,0:55:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会一路都那么好玩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't suppose it'll be all fun and games.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.19,0:55:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,美丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mei-Lei.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.20,0:55:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要什么吗？邦德先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I do something for you, Mr Bond?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.74,0:55:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要来杯酒 马丁尼 要摇动的…不要搅拌的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a drink. A martini, shaken not stirred.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.41,0:55:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你也来一杯吗？- 当值时不喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Won't you join me? - Not on duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.58,0:55:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是金手指先生的私人机师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Mr Goldfinger's personal pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.54,0:55:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.71,0:55:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,多私人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And just how personal is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.26,0:55:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个好飞行员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a damn good pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.43,0:55:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Period!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.64,0:55:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's good news. By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.22,0:55:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 主人呢？- 他先去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- where is our host? - He flew on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.31,0:56:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.49,0:56:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬满贯计划！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's to Operation Grand Slam.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.62,0:56:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次将是值得纪念的飞行\N{\fnArial\fs30}This should be a memorable flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.25,0:56:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必表现魅力了 我免疫的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can turn off the charm. I'm immune.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.43,0:56:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,55分钟后 我们会在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be landing in Baltimore,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.35,0:56:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,…巴尔的摩的机场降落 进入美国领土\N{\fnArial\fs30}our port of entry into the United States, in 55 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.19,0:56:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,美丽…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mei-Lei.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.07,0:56:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,…到达时我想穿正式点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would like to arrive more appropriately dressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.49,0:56:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的行李跟我一样 存活下来了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did any of my luggage survive with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.41,0:56:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,随身手提箱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my attach?case?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.58,0:57:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 黑色手提箱 检查时已经损坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black attach?case damaged when examined. So sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.75,0:57:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies quite unnecessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.34,0:57:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛尼 叫美丽注意他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sydney, tell Mei-Lei to keep an eye on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.97,0:58:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,20分钟后降落\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be landing in 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.39,0:58:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要乖点还是玩狠的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to play it easy… or the hard way?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.06,0:58:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是麻醉枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this isn't a tranquilliser.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.23,0:59:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对飞机比枪了解得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pussy, you know a lot more about planes than guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.61,0:59:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是史密斯威森45手枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a Smith & Wesson. 45.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.03,0:59:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你近距离开枪 子弹会穿过我和机身…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you fire this close, the bullet will pass through me and the fuselage.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.07,0:59:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,…像火焰枪穿过奶油一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}like a blowtorch through butter.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.24,0:59:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,机身内压力减低 我们全会被吸出机外\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cabin will depressurise and we'll be sucked into outer space together.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.50,0:59:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想这样去美国\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that's how you want to arrive, you're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.17,0:59:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,请便 我喜欢比较容易的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}As for me, I prefer the easier way.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.34,0:59:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,合情合理\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's very sensible.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.38,0:59:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,何况呆在金手指四周的 节目很精彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's so much going on around Mr Goldfinger,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.55,0:59:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会不接受他热情款待\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't dream of not accepting his… hospitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.34,0:59:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也会很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be very glad to see you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.51,0:59:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢以身试险 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like close shaves, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.56,0:59:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,华盛顿电话 绿色电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Washington, sir. On the green scrambler.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.98,0:59:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是M - 是莱特 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- M here. - Leiter, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.28,0:59:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是关于007 我们收到他的讯号\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about 007, sir. We picked up his homer signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.16,0:59:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他刚降落在巴尔的摩\N{\fnArial\fs30}from Friendship Airport, Baltimore, where he's just landed.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.87,0:59:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尔的摩？真高兴他通知我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baltimore? Nice of him to let us know.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.20,0:59:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们听说他最后在瑞士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last we heard, he was in Switzerland.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.37,0:59:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他坐私人喷射机进入的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He came in on a private jet, ex Geneva.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.54,1:00:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,机主是老朋友 金手指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Registered to our old friend Auric Goldfinger.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.34,1:00:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴他有进展 留意他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad he's making progress. Keep an eye on him for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.09,1:00:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞行目的地是肯德基 蓝草机场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bluegrass Field, Kentucky, is their final destination.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.38,1:00:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,别打草惊蛇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't charge in on him and spoil anything, will you?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.18,1:00:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,此刻他一定掌握全局了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's evidently well on top at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.83,1:00:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 邦德先生 请 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr Bond. - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.17,1:00:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,随时候教\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any time.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.46,1:00:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.93,1:00:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心步阶 机长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do mind your step, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.10,1:00:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep playing it easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.19,1:01:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,看一切是否安排好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mei-Lei, will you see everything's all right with Mr Goldfinger?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.82,1:01:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll see you surprisingly soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.80,1:01:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这团体很专业 - 应该的 是我训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Talented chaps. - They should be. I trained them.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.97,1:01:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.97,1:01:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,普西 你是个多才多艺的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a woman of many parts, Pussy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.14,1:01:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信肯德基的酒 和泉水一定极佳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe the bourbon and branch water is rather splendid here in Kentucky.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.31,1:01:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们不用当值了 也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now that we're both off duty, perhaps…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.53,1:01:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,礼貌 “怪侠”\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manners, "Oddjob".
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.53,1:01:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你见到女子都会脱帽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you always took your hat off to a lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.33,1:01:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他杀害像你这种小女孩 - 还有小男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know, he kills little girls like you. - Little boys, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.67,1:02:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 预演得很顺利 - 很好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dress rehearsal went like a dream. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.30,1:02:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚宣布最后简报 现在解散\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your final briefing is tonight. That'll be all for now.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.83,1:03:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到奥瑞克养马场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Auric Stud, Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.87,1:03:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,很美的动物 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovely animal, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.04,1:03:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,比马主人还美得多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly better bred than the owner.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.67,1:03:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,带邦德先生去他的睡房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show Mr Bond to his quarters, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.78,1:04:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,费立斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Felix!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.91,1:04:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许该直接闯进去 - 如果需要我们他会大叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe we should just drop in on him. - He'll shout if he needs us.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.08,1:04:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,金手指先生 他们都到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all here, Mr Goldfinger.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.84,1:04:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 对 谢谢 基区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes! Thank you, Kisch.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.89,1:05:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,索罗那小子 会把鞋磨个洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}That guy Solo's gonna wear a hole in his shoes.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.48,1:05:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I like this!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.65,1:05:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.78,1:05:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何我们没被告知纽约和 西海岸也有份？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goldfinger, why weren't we told New York and the West Coast were in on this?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.49,1:05:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,看谁在说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look who's talking!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.83,1:05:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不和芝加哥做生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not do business with Chicago.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.29,1:05:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我们有个 秘密的生意要处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we had a private business deal to settle.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.25,1:05:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在却发现参加了大团聚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I find I'm attending a hoods' convention.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.00,1:05:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已交货了 钱呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goldfinger, I made a delivery. Where is my money?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.38,1:05:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也交货了 - 你们全交货了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I made a delivery, too. - You all made the deliveries we agreed.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.38,1:05:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你欠我一百万元\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you owe me one million bucks.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.84,1:05:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我欠你们每人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe each of you a million.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.76,1:05:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,一百万金块\N{\fnArial\fs30}in gold bullion.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.93,1:05:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就付钱！\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, pay!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.64,1:05:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 你们今天可以 拿到一百万…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, you can have the million today.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.27,1:05:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,…或是明天拿到一千万！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or ten millions tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.44,1:05:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,一千万？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you say ten million?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.74,1:06:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,只等明天银行早上开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as my bank opens in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.49,1:06:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,银行周日不营业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Banks don't open on Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.62,1:06:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的银行会营业\N{\fnArial\fs30}My bank will.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.83,1:06:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这撞球台玩什么花样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with that trick pool table?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.93,1:06:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 掩护！- 守住大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cover him! - Hey, cover those doors.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.47,1:06:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,开灯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn those lights back on!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.77,1:06:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你玩什么把戏？金手指\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you trying to pull, Goldfinger?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.11,1:06:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 不必紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no cause for alarm, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.32,1:06:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢被困着 地图有何作用？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like being cooped up like this. What's that map doing there?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.42,1:06:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的银行\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my bank.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.59,1:07:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,存放在诺克斯堡的黄金\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gold depository at Fort Knox, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.22,1:07:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面有150亿元…\N{\fnArial\fs30}In its vaults are $15 billion.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.18,1:07:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,…供应全美国的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The entire gold supply.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.52,1:07:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄金存货\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the United States.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.64,1:07:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,抢劫诺克斯堡？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knock off Fort Knox!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.85,1:07:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有钥匙吗？- 差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got a key or somethin'? - Of a kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.40,1:07:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有3万5千名军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are 35, 000 troops stationed around there!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.07,1:07:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,4万1千名\N{\fnArial\fs30}41, 000.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.24,1:07:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁来制服他们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who's gonna say boo to them, Goldfinger?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.82,1:07:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事？- 这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on here? - What is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.83,1:07:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 地板 - 这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The floor! - What is this? A merry-go-round?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.43,1:07:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类已登上额菲尔士峰…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man has climbed Mount Everest,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.98,1:08:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,…深入海底\N{\fnArial\fs30}gone to the bottom of the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.40,1:08:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射火箭到月球\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has fired rockets to the moon.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.57,1:08:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,分裂原子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Split the atom.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.74,1:08:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,创造了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Achieved miracles.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.78,1:08:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,…人类极限能力下的奇迹 除了犯罪以外！\N{\fnArial\fs30}in every field of human endeavour… except crime!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.70,1:10:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑道人物将会震惊世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}The underworld will applaud for centuries!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.91,1:10:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 废话少说 - 说重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cut the commercial! - Get to the point!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.21,1:10:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在浪费我的时间 金库是攻不破的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pointless. The depository's impregnable.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.96,1:10:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 金库防爆 电网 - 请耐心点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The joint is bombproof, electrified… - Bear with me, please!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.84,1:10:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺克斯堡也是个银行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fort Knox is a bank. Like any other.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.68,1:10:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许更大受更多保护 但还是间银行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larger, better protected perhaps, but nonetheless a bank!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.80,1:10:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,它可以 我想该说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can be… I think the expression is.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.52,1:10:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,…爆破！\N{\fnArial\fs30}blown.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.23,1:10:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的计划傻瓜也能办到\N{\fnArial\fs30}My plan is foolproof, gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.19,1:10:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫做…满贯计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call it Operation Grand Slam.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.57,1:10:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我投注15年的心血\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have devoted 15 years of my life to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.11,1:10:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个细节都仔细核对 准备妥当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every detail has been scrupulously prepared.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.53,1:10:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,每件事都考虑过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every eventuality has been considered.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.07,1:10:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个计划会分秒不差进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll operate on a split-second schedule.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.62,1:11:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的组织 夜先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your organisation, Mr Midnight,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.79,1:11:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,负责运送金属罐…通过加拿大边界\N{\fnArial\fs30}brought a batch of these canisters across the Canadian border.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.63,1:11:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,内装着雕尔塔9号\N{\fnArial\fs30}They contain Delta 9.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.21,1:11:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是什么？- 无色无味的神经毒气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Delta 9? What's that? - An invisible nerve gas.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.63,1:11:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射后15分钟扩散…\N{\fnArial\fs30}which disperses 15 minutes after inducing complete… unconsciousness.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.22,1:11:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,…能让人昏迷24小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}for 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.89,1:11:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天凌晨…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow at dawn,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.06,1:11:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我飞行马戏团的飞机师 普西小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}the flying circus of my personal pilot, Miss Pussy Galore,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.48,1:11:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,会把它撒在大气层\N{\fnArial\fs30}will spray it into the atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.53,1:11:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦扩散 整个军队所有人全昏迷…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once the population, including the military, has been immobilised.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.62,1:11:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我的攻击部队 由史先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}my task force, which Mr Strap and his people.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.54,1:11:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,将他们从墨西哥偷渡来此…\N{\fnArial\fs30}smuggled across the Rio Grande from Mexico,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.66,1:11:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,…会乘坐机动车辆经过 通到金库前…\N{\fnArial\fs30}will approach Fort Knox in motorised equipment.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.83,1:11:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,…和格瓦道交接的…布李街…\N{\fnArial\fs30}along Bullion Boulevard, which runs past the depository here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.88,1:11:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,…到达诺克斯堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}and intersects with Gold Vault Road.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.22,1:11:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这道金库周围的围墙…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This fence surrounding the depository,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.01,1:12:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,…正如史先生提醒 有电流\N{\fnArial\fs30}as Mr Strap reminded us, is electrified.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.68,1:12:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,将被炸毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be dynamited!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.85,1:12:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的部队将由 主要通道摧毁一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}My task force will then move to the main entrance and demolish it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.35,1:12:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么摧毁 请问？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How, may I ask?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.52,1:12:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,索罗先生 靠你了 经由你在运输界的影响力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made that possible, Mr Solo. By using your influence in shipping circles.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.24,1:12:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用通过海关的检查…\N{\fnArial\fs30}to bring through customs uninspected.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.78,1:12:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,…箱外打上“机械零件”\N{\fnArial\fs30}a consignment labelled machine parts.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.95,1:12:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的只是要进入这个…存放金块的金库\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that will then remain is to descend to the vaults where the bullion is stored.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.91,1:12:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我听够了 - 让他去完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've heard enough. - Let him finish.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.08,1:12:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不反对的话 我现在拿我的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you have no objection… I'll take my money now.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.54,1:12:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,索罗 怎么了？大到你无法应付？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter, Solo? Too big for you to handle?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.10,1:12:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该尊重索罗先生的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must respect Mr Solo's decision.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.31,1:12:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,请恕我失陪 我先招呼他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me for a moment while I take care of him. Make yourselves comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.10,1:13:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,普西！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pussy!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.26,1:13:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁教你柔道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who taught you judo?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.52,1:13:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿走的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gun you took.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.81,1:13:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.82,1:13:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪 当然啦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gun, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.41,1:13:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,改天一定要较量一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must have a few fast falls together some time.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.89,1:14:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,老史 如果他有答案…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Strap! He's got the right answers.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.52,1:14:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我们不必亲赴现场 手下能应付一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me don't even have to be there. The boys can handle everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.74,1:14:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把壁炉封闭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, they closed up the fireplace!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.82,1:14:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不喜欢这样 - 怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't like this! - What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.21,1:14:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒气！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gas!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.57,1:15:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜 你选择不加入其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a pity you did not choose to remain with the others, Mr Solo. However…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.95,1:15:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 我以为你在睡房休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Bond, I thought you were resting in your quarters.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.37,1:15:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡得很舒适！不过天气太好了 还是出来走走\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are delightful. But it's much too nice to stay indoors.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.33,1:15:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我碰上葛小姐 她建议我们加入你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ran into Miss Galore and she suggested that we join you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.09,1:15:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是索先生 这是邦德先生 我另一位贵宾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Solo, Mr Bond. Another of my distinguished guests.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.55,1:15:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈喽 - 索先生 这么快要走？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. - Leaving us so soon, Mr Solo?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.72,1:15:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很不幸 他另外有紧急的约会 - 我想动身了 金手指\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He has a pressing engagement. - Yeah. I'd like to get started, Goldfinger.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.55,1:15:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小子 - 该走的时候就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Boy! - When you gotta go, you gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.18,1:15:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的飞机会准时送你到纽约…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My plane will get you to New York on time.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.89,1:15:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,…和你超多的行李\N{\fnArial\fs30}with your excess luggage.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.36,1:15:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.23,1:15:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的司机是个好司机 你马上就会到机场\N{\fnArial\fs30}My chauffeur's an excellent driver. You will be at the airport in a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.78,1:15:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,再会 索先生 也许下次吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, Mr Solo. Some other time, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.45,1:15:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,平安落地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy landings, old boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.54,1:15:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在模型下发现他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found him under the model.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.50,1:16:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,满贯行动！我喜欢你的简报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Operation Grand Slam. I did enjoy your briefing.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.30,1:16:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So did I.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.86,1:16:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他出发了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on the move.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.60,1:16:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢点 别太近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow down, don't crowd him.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.66,1:17:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你瞎了吗？你错过转弯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you blind or something? You missed the turn!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.11,1:17:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们前面右转了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've turned to the right just ahead here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.88,1:18:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这位老朋友去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's this old pal of yours headed?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.17,1:18:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,十赌一 他去找女人或喝酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten'll get you one, it's a drink or a dame.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.51,1:20:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,收不到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.05,1:20:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许是机件故障 - 除非他关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mechanical failure, maybe? - Unless he switched it off.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.31,1:20:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为何这么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would he do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.64,1:20:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们只能开去农场 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Drive to the farm, it's all we can do. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.20,1:20:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在满贯行动分到的 足够让你成为富婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your share of Operation Grand Slam will make you a very rich woman, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.59,1:20:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我为何参与？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why else would I be in it, Mr Goldfinger?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.51,1:20:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会在英国养老吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll retire to England, I suppose?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.84,1:20:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我看中巴哈马 之中的一个小岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I've spotted a little island in the Bahamas.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.97,1:21:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会挂起“不准进入”的牌子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll hang up a sign, "no trespassing",
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.47,1:21:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,…然后回归自然\N{\fnArial\fs30}and go back to nature.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.10,1:21:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 基区 什么事？- 两个人乘一部车带着望远镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, Kisch? - Two men in a car with binoculars.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.27,1:21:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌徒寻找赛马消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Touts looking for racing tips.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.74,1:21:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有另一个可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's another possibility, however.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.20,1:21:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫邦德先生加入我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kisch, ask Mr Bond to join us.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.37,1:21:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那些人是邦德的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were right to spare Mr Bond's life in Switzerland,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.58,1:21:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在瑞士放他一命就做对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if those gentlemen are his friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.83,1:21:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说服他们 他不需要协助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's convince them he needs no assistance.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.92,1:21:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了他们的福利 让他尽量快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}For their benefit, Pussy, let's make him as happy as possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.80,1:21:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议你换件更适合的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest you change into something more suitable.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.18,1:21:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.68,1:21:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,先公后私\N{\fnArial\fs30}Business before pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.20,1:22:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.80,1:22:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Bond. Sit down, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.67,1:22:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,薄荷茶？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mint julep?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.84,1:22:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 传统口味 还不错 - 好 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Traditional, but satisfying. - Yes, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.68,1:22:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,酸麦的 但请不要太甜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sour mash, but not too sweet, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.10,1:22:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,金手指 你令我失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}You disappoint me, Goldfinger.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.27,1:22:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,满贯计划不会成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know Operation Grand Slam simply won't work.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.23,1:22:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便说一下 这神经毒气会致命\N{\fnArial\fs30}And incidentally Delta 9 nerve gas is fatal.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.48,1:22:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你消息还是一样灵通\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are unusually well informed, Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.28,1:22:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会让六万人死得不明不白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll kill 60, 000 people uselessly.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.86,1:22:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国每两年车祸 死亡人数就这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha! American motorists kill that many every two years.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.41,1:22:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 而我自己也计算一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well… I've worked out a few statistics of my own.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.00,1:22:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,150亿元金块\N{\fnArial\fs30}$15 billion.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.17,1:22:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,重达1万5百吨\N{\fnArial\fs30}in gold bullion weighs 10, 500 tons.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.92,1:23:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,六十人要搬十二天…装载在2百辆卡车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}60 men would take 12 days to load it onto 200 trucks.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.22,1:23:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你顶多只有两小时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the most, you'll have two hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.38,1:23:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,…在陆海空军到达之前 搬货\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the army, navy, air force, marines move in and make you put it back.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.68,1:23:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说要搬走？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who mentioned anything about removing it?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.02,1:23:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,饮料够吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the julep tart enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.52,1:23:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你计划闯入世界最大的银行…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You plan to break into the world's largest bank.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.65,1:23:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,…却不偷东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not to steal anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.07,1:23:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.03,1:23:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.74,1:23:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,林先生 中共派驻工厂代表…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Ling, the Red Chinese agent at the factory?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.87,1:23:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,…他是核子分解专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a specialist in nuclear fission…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.04,1:23:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来如此 他的政府要给你个炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}But of course! His government's given you a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.30,1:23:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我情愿叫做原子装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prefer to call it an atomic device.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.88,1:23:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,很小 很脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's small but particularly dirty.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.43,1:23:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 钴和碘？- 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cobalt and iodine? - Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.43,1:23:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你引爆诺克斯堡…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you explode it in Fort Knox, the…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.68,1:23:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,…全美的黄金的存货…将会受幅射影响…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…entire gold supply of the United States will be radioactive for…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.15,1:23:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,…57年\N{\fnArial\fs30}…57 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.32,1:24:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,正确说来是58年\N{\fnArial\fs30}58, to be exact.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.94,1:24:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抱歉 真是启发性的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I apologise, Goldfinger. It's an inspired deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.91,1:24:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们得到他们要的 西方经济危机\N{\fnArial\fs30}They get what they want, economic chaos in the West.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.12,1:24:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的黄金价值提升好几倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the value of your gold increases many times.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.16,1:24:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,保守估计十倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I conservatively estimate… ten times.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.87,1:24:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,精明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.67,1:24:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你所谓的原子装置…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the atomic device, as you call it,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.76,1:24:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,…显然已经在这国家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}is already, obviously, in this country.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.18,1:24:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.93,1:24:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但放进诺克斯堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}But bringing it to Fort Knox undetected.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.77,1:24:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不被侦测到 很冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}could be risky. Very risky.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.89,1:24:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,正好相反 你们才冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the contrary, Mr Bond. The risk is all on your side.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.81,1:24:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们想去寻找\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the authorities should attempt to locate it,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.02,1:24:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道会在哪里爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}who knows where it might be exploded?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.65,1:24:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许停泊在新伦敦的潜艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps the Polaris submarine pens at New London,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.74,1:24:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,在肯尼迪角？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cape Kennedy,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.78,1:24:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠近白宫？\N{\fnArial\fs30}near the White House.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.83,1:24:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们仔细计划过了 满贯行动会成功的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we are speculating idly. Operation Grand Slam will be successful.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.08,1:24:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会当场见到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be there to see for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.33,1:24:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概会很不舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too closely for comfort, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.05,1:25:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me, Mr Bond,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.22,1:25:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须由故索先生身上 拿回黄金\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I must arrange to separate my gold from the late Mr Solo.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.69,1:25:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如你所说 他有个很急的约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you said, he had a pressing engagement.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.57,1:25:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,很美 葛小姐！不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very chic, Miss Galore. Don't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.49,1:25:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,普西 款待邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please entertain Mr Bond for me, Pussy.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.70,1:25:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll join you both later.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.24,1:25:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,帅哥 如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about it, handsome?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.41,1:25:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得我们应该 趁次机会认识彼此？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think it's time we got to know each other socially?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.79,1:25:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,新的葛小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}The new Miss Galore.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.96,1:25:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把金手筘藏在这身衣服哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you hide your gold knuckles in this outfit?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.88,1:25:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我下班后从不带武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never carry weapons after business hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.97,1:25:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？原来你不当值了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? So you're off duty?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.76,1:25:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我毫无防备\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm completely defenceless.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.81,1:25:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So am I.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.81,1:26:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是我的詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my James!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.23,1:26:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,金手指的地方很美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful place Goldfinger has here.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.78,1:26:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 很高兴你喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'm glad you're enjoying it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.20,1:26:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,太可惜了 明早一切就毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too bad it all has to end tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.78,1:26:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 他有点疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's quite mad, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.00,1:26:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里面有什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now. What do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.08,1:26:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,007似乎把情形处理得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}007 seems to have the situation well in hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.80,1:26:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我累了 回酒店去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, I'm bushed. Let's get back to the motel.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.92,1:26:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是很不平凡的女孩 - 我生性好动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're quite a girl, Pussy. - I'm strictly the outdoor type.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.39,1:26:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你没有参与整件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to think you're not in all of this… caper.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.56,1:26:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不谈了 我没有兴趣 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skip it. I'm not interested. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.27,1:26:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,要怎样才能让你以 我的方式看事情？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would it take for you to see things my way?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.48,1:26:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有那能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot more than you've got.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.94,1:26:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道？- 我不想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you know? - I don't want to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.61,1:26:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵照将死的人的要求 是否为惯例？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't it customary to grant a condemned man his last request?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.37,1:26:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自找的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've asked for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.04,1:27:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.13,1:27:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.94,1:27:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在让我们一起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now let's both play.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.85,1:27:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,普西呼叫香槟领队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pussy Galore to Champagne leader.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.22,1:28:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥摇摆宝贝 祝好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commence Rockabye Baby. Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.37,1:28:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,速度：220\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speed: 220.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.58,1:28:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,风向：西风\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wind check: Westerly.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.22,1:28:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,香槟领队呼叫香槟队员 准备俯冲！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Champagne leader to Champagne section. Commence dive… now.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.24,1:28:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备摇摆宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready for Rockabye Baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.41,1:28:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,喷洒开始倒数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commence spray on countdown.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.49,1:28:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,五\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.99,1:29:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,四 三 二\N{\fnArial\fs30}four, three, two,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.33,1:29:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,零\N{\fnArial\fs30}zero.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.89,1:30:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,香槟领队呼叫满贯行动领队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Champagne leader to Grand Slam task force leader.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.73,1:30:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝已睡着\N{\fnArial\fs30}The baby is asleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.86,1:30:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复 宝贝已睡着 我们回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I repeat, the baby is asleep. We're going home now.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.61,1:30:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.80,1:35:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,早 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.96,1:35:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次你终于 在我想你在的地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For once, you are exactly where I want you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.91,1:36:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 炸弹在此 - 出发吧 准将\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The bomb's here. - Let's get moving, Brigadier.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.87,1:36:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 出发 - 以作战战形出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right, Jack, move in. - Move in, commando tactics.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.33,1:36:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到炸弹解除前 只做防卫性开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minimum offensive fire until I signal bomb has been neutralised.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.09,1:36:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到炸弹解除前 只做防卫性开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minimum offensive fire until I signal bomb has been neutralised.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.17,1:36:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸弹拆除小组待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bomb disposal unit to accompany DOG.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.13,1:37:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.50,1:38:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在只是时间问题而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Ling, it is merely timing…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.53,1:38:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也是一员 女孩也是！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's one of them, so is the girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.70,1:38:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去抓他 你们把门打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get her, you get the door open.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.30,1:39:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被困住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're trapped!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.22,1:39:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸弹 我要把信管拿掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bomb… I'll take the fuse out.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.97,1:39:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,别当傻子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be a fool!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.14,1:39:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当英雄 我不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can be a hero, I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.35,1:39:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.89,1:44:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.12,1:44:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事耽搁你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kept you?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.95,1:45:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好吧？那位管家朋友呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You OK, James? Where's your butler friend?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.33,1:45:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他弄坏了保险丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}He blew a fuse.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.25,1:45:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,再多三秒 金手指就成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three more ticks and Mr Goldfinger would've hit the jackpot.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.88,1:45:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抓到他了吗？- 还没 他跑不远\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you get him? - Not yet, but he won't get far.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.55,1:45:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 普西呢？- 是她帮我们换过毒气瓶\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And Pussy? - She helped to switch the canisters.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.80,1:45:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么使她通知华府的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, what made her call Washington?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.97,1:45:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定启发了她母性的本能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must have appealed to her maternal instincts.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.27,1:45:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 上机 别让总统等太久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, James. Get aboard. You can't keep the President waiting.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.61,1:45:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,专机 白宫吃午餐 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Special plane, lunch at the White House. How come?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.78,1:45:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统要亲自谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The President wants to thank you personally.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.37,1:45:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这没有什么 - 我知道 但他不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was nothing, really. - I know that, but he doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.54,1:45:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我可以在机上喝杯酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose I'll be able to get a drink here.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.08,1:45:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我通知空中小姐 准备三人份的酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told the stewardess liquor for three.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.29,1:45:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 另外两人是谁？- 没有别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are the other two? - There are no other two.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.04,1:45:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 费立斯 - 再见 祝好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Goodbye, Felix. - So long. Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.38,1:45:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 祝好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you, Brigadier. - Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.16,1:46:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎你登机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad to have you aboard, Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.54,1:46:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你升官了 金手指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, congratulations on your promotion, Goldfinger.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.21,1:46:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也要去白宫进午餐吗？- 两小时候 我就会在古巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you going to the White House, too? - In two hours I shall be in Cuba.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.14,1:46:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你最后一次破坏我计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have interfered with my plans for the last time, Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.51,1:46:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,机内开枪很危险 我甚至也警告过普西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very dangerous to fire guns in planes. I even had to warn Pussy about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.73,1:46:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她在哪儿？- 我等会处置她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- By the way, where is she? - I will deal with her later.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.15,1:46:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在她该在的地方 驾驶舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is where she ought to be… at the controls.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.24,1:47:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,普西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pussy!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.70,1:47:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？金手指呢？- 去弹金竖琴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? Where's Goldfinger? - Playing his golden harp.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.66,1:47:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是好现象\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no good.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.08,1:48:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不可以！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, you don't!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.45,1:48:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,此刻不适合被救援\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is no time to be rescued.
